# Orlando's Antiques (otherAreas 7): Orlando (Mhaura; no DefaultActions entry, no other quest: his script calls the
# quest whole). A WAR 20. No fame, no license: 100. Windurst fame level 2 (50) and the Chocobo License (GMs): available,
# 8 Beastcoins: nothing; 101: begun (no option read). Accepted: 103 (its finish: not completed, nothing). Trades: 7
# Beastcoins: 104; 7 and a Goblin Die (8 in all, not 8 of the slot's item): nothing; 9 Beastcoins (trade:hasItemQty is
# exact: 9 is not 8): nothing; 8: 102 (600, 656): the trade taken, Windurst fame +10, 600 gil, completed, ANTIQUE_PAYOUT
# 0. Completed, OrlandoRepeat 0: 8 Goblin Dice: nothing. 103: OrlandoRepeat 1; 8 Goblin Dice: 102 (120, 568): completed
# again, OrlandoRepeat 0. 103 again (OrlandoRepeat 1): a cabbage in the first slot (not an antique) and a die: nothing
# (the die's slot would play 104).
char zone=Mhaura pos=-36.5,-8.0,59.3 job=WAR lvl=20
item Beastcoin x9
item GoblinDie x9
item LaTheineCabbage x1
login
trigger Orlando                         # no fame, no license: 100
finish
fame Windurst 50                        # a GM: level 2
keyitem ChocoboLicense                  # a GM
trade Orlando Beastcoin x8              # available, OrlandoRepeat 0: nothing
trigger Orlando                         # available: 101
finish                                  # begun
trigger Orlando                         # accepted: 103
finish                                  # not completed: nothing
trade Orlando Beastcoin x7              # fewer than 8: 104
finish
trade Orlando Beastcoin x7 GoblinDie x1 # 8 items, not 8 of the slot's: nothing
trade Orlando Beastcoin x9              # hasItemQty(656, 8) is exact: 9 is not 8: nothing
trade Orlando Beastcoin x8              # 102 (600, 656)
finish                                  # the 8 taken; Windurst fame +10; 600 gil; completed; ANTIQUE_PAYOUT 0
trade Orlando GoblinDie x8              # completed, OrlandoRepeat 0: nothing
trigger Orlando                         # completed: 103
finish                                  # OrlandoRepeat 1
trade Orlando GoblinDie x8              # 102 (120, 568)
finish                                  # taken; fame +10; 120 gil; completed again; OrlandoRepeat 0
trigger Orlando                         # 103
finish                                  # OrlandoRepeat 1
trade Orlando LaTheineCabbage x1 GoblinDie x1  # the first slot's item no antique: nothing
